# Publish

This repository publishes `@vitrion/n8n-nodes-zentria`. ZentriaApp only vendors the submodule.

Tag `X.Y.Z` here and push it. Workflow `.github/workflows/publish.yml` publishes with OIDC.

Never publish from ZentriaApp. Never `npm publish` locally.
